{"seq":58,"slug":"matlab-numerical-computing","title":"MATLAB 数值计算","stage":"DONE","category":"languages","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/matlab-numerical-computing","rating":{"composite":4.01,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.8,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":5,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"matlab-数值计算\">MATLAB 数值计算</h1><p>MATLAB 不是一门&quot;通用编程语言碰巧能算数值&quot;，而是一套从语言核心到运行时、再到工具箱与图形系统，全部围绕&quot;稠密矩阵&quot;这一数据原语长出来的科学计算环境。理解它的最快路径，是先承认它的世界观：在 MATLAB 里，标量只是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1\\times 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 的矩阵，循环往往是性能反模式，而一行矩阵表达式背后是 LAPACK、BLAS、MKL 在替你做并行。这个 hub 用四条递进的主线，把这套世界观从直觉讲到能落地交付。</p>\n<p>第一条主线是<strong>基础</strong>：MATLAB 在 2026 年究竟解决谁的问题、矩阵优先意味着写代码时该如何思考、以及它赖以高产的交互式工作流（命令行试错、Live Script、断点调试）。这条线建立&quot;为什么 MATLAB 值得学&quot;的判断，也为后面所有章节定下&quot;先想成矩阵&quot;的基调。</p>\n<p>第二条主线是<strong>语言</strong>：把基础里的直觉落到语法。向量化是把显式循环改写成数组运算的工程方法（也是性能的命门）；函数与脚本厘清 MATLAB 独特的文件即函数、工作区、闭包规则；数据类型与数组则越过双精度矩阵，进入 cell、struct、table、string、categorical 这些承载真实数据的容器。</p>\n<p>第三条主线是<strong>数值</strong>：MATLAB 真正的主场。线性代数与求解讲反斜杠 <code>\\</code> 背后的算法选择与各种矩阵分解；微分方程与优化覆盖 <code>ode45</code> 家族与 <code>fmincon</code>/<code>fzero</code>；绘图与可视化讲它独步同类的图形系统。第四条主线是<strong>实践</strong>：工具箱与 Simulink 的模型化设计、MATLAB Coder 的代码生成与部署、以及最关键的选型——什么时候该用 MATLAB，什么时候该交给别人。</p>\n<p>四条线的关系是层层递进：基础给世界观，语言给手艺，数值给杀手锏，实践给落地与边界。<strong>推荐学习路径</strong>——若你是有 3 到 7 年经验、从 Python/C 转来的工程师，按 基础 → 语言 → 数值 → 实践 顺序通读即可；若你只为解一个具体的数值问题（解线性方程组、拟合、跑 ODE），可以先读 <a href=\"foundations/matrix-first\">矩阵优先思维</a> 建立索引心智，再直接跳到 <a href=\"numerics/linear-algebra-solving\">线性代数与求解</a>；若你在评估&quot;要不要引入 MATLAB&quot;，请直接看 <a href=\"practice/matlab-when-to-use\">选型与边界</a>。<strong>前置知识</strong>：线性代数（矩阵乘法、特征值、最小二乘的直觉）、一门命令式语言的基本功、微积分常识；不需要任何 MATLAB 经验。</p>\n<p><strong>本 hub 与兄弟 hub 的分工</strong>：本 hub 只讲 MATLAB 这一具体环境的语言机制与数值生态，不展开通用数值分析理论。同样面向科学计算的 <a href=\"../julia-scientific/\">Julia</a> 讲的是&quot;为性能与多重派发重新设计的开源替代&quot;，<a href=\"../r-statistical-computing/\">R 统计计算</a> 讲的是&quot;统计与数据框优先&quot;，<a href=\"../fortran-scientific/\">Fortran</a> 讲的是&quot;高性能数值内核的底层语言&quot;，而 <a href=\"../python-advanced/\">Python 进阶</a> 的 NumPy/科学栈是 MATLAB 最常被拿来对比的开源生态。这些 hub 在 <a href=\"practice/matlab-when-to-use\">选型与边界</a> 一篇里会被正面横向比较——其余各篇遇到它们时只做一句点链接，不重复展开，避免知识重叠。读完本 hub，你应当既能用 MATLAB 高效解决数值问题，也能清醒判断它在你的技术栈里值不值这张授权费。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/matlab-numerical-computing/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"why-matlab","title":"为何 MATLAB","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/matlab-numerical-computing/foundations/why-matlab"},{"seq":2,"slug":"matrix-first","title":"矩阵优先思维","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/matlab-numerical-computing/foundations/matrix-first"},{"seq":3,"slug":"interactive-workflow","title":"交互式工作流","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/matlab-numerical-computing/foundations/interactive-workflow"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"language","title":"语言","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/matlab-numerical-computing/language","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"vectorization","title":"向量化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/matlab-numerical-computing/language/vectorization"},{"seq":2,"slug":"functions-scripts","title":"函数与脚本","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/matlab-numerical-computing/language/functions-scripts"},{"seq":3,"slug":"data-types-arrays","title":"数据类型与数组","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/matlab-numerical-computing/language/data-types-arrays"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"numerics","title":"数值","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/matlab-numerical-computing/numerics","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"linear-algebra-solving","title":"线性代数与求解","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/matlab-numerical-computing/numerics/linear-algebra-solving"},{"seq":2,"slug":"ode-optimization","title":"微分方程与优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/matlab-numerical-computing/numerics/ode-optimization"},{"seq":3,"slug":"plotting-visualization","title":"绘图与可视化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/matlab-numerical-computing/numerics/plotting-visualization"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"practice","title":"实践","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/matlab-numerical-computing/practice","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"toolboxes-simulink","title":"工具箱与 Simulink","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/matlab-numerical-computing/practice/toolboxes-simulink"},{"seq":2,"slug":"codegen-deployment","title":"代码生成与部署","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/matlab-numerical-computing/practice/codegen-deployment"},{"seq":3,"slug":"matlab-when-to-use","title":"选型与边界","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/matlab-numerical-computing/practice/matlab-when-to-use"}]}]}